\title{Preference-feedback distortion}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{preference-data}
\tag{lower-bound}

\p{A finite routing model supports preference-distortion lower bounds in
Sections 2--3 and Appendix A of \citef{zhao2025limits}. Cardinal queries
permit a different guarantee under the hypotheses of
\citef{amanatidis2021peeking}.}

\p{Both comparisons depend on the queries, circuits, routing maps, utility,
feedback profile, algorithm, and comparator class. The noiseless and
Bradley--Terry bounds retain those model restrictions.}

